3. THIRD-PARTY MATERIALS. Sonmal quotes or uses the materials below;
   those parts are governed by their own terms, not this license:
   - Korean Sign Language Dictionary headwords and handshape
     descriptions quoted from the National Institute of Korean Language
     (CC BY-NC-ND 2.0 KR);
   - MediaPipe Tasks and hand/face models (Google, Apache License 2.0);
   - Fonts IBM Plex Sans KR and Inter (their respective licenses).
   Sonmal's illustrations are not reproductions of that dictionary's
   photos or videos; they are drawn anew from headwords and handshape
   descriptions.

4. NO WARRANTY. The Work is provided "as is". Sonmal is a practice tool
   to help learn Korean Sign Language; it does not assess signing skill
   or provide official translation. The author gives no warranty of any
   kind and is not liable for any damages arising from use of the Work.

5. PERMISSIONS. For any use the sections above prohibit, contact the
   author via github.com/aueoj/sonmal to request written permission.
